          "text": "代表工作\n  \n   \n    On the power of foundation models\n    Yang Yuan\n    《孟子·告子下》：有诸内，必形诸外。《黄帝内经·灵枢·外揣》：司外揣内，司内揣外。\n   \n    Contrastive learning is spectral clustering on similarity grap",
